{
"markdown": "### DynamicNotch\n\nMakes use of the notch area to show notifications, activities, navigation and smooth, adjustable glass effects.\n\n> **Note:** Recommended only for notched iPhones with Dynamic Island disabled. Not recommended if the device uses a native or simulated Dynamic Island. User-tested on iOS 15, 16, 17, and 18.",
"useSpacing": false,
"class": "DepictionMarkdownView"
},
{
"class": "DepictionScreenshotsView",
"screenshots": [
{
"url": "https://jtisvn.github.io/infodeb/DynamicNotch/Screenshots/1.png",
"accessibilityText": "Screenshot 1"
}
],
"itemCornerRadius": 12,
"itemSize": "{185,400}"
},
{
"markdown": "- **Key Features:**\n\n- **Activity Integration:** Displays notifications, music playback, calls, timers, stopwatch, screen/audio recording, and volume.\n- **System Status:** Supports Focus modes, system toggles, and Apple Watch charging alerts.\n- **Live Activities:** Compact and expanded views for supported real-time activities.\n- **Independent Glass:** Adjustable fill, blur, refraction, thickness, and edge highlights.\n- **Smart Compatibility:** Supports notch avoidance with Lunora and an option to use system notifications in landscape.",
"useSpacing": false,
"class": "DepictionMarkdownView"
},
